<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - WorldCom upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Timothy Horan confirmed that he upgraded WorldCom Inc to an outperform from a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- said upgrade based on price of the stock and positive fundamentals of the company.</p>
<p>-- said price target is $30 to $35.</p>
<p>-- WorldCom stock traded up 1/2 to 23-3/4 Wednesday morning.</p>
</text>
